 urgent compliance queries within 8 business hours; available Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm IST</p><p>&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Minimum 10 years of hands-on experience in information security and GRC</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Proven track record conducting ISO 27001 internal/external audits across technology, financial services, healthcare, or professional services</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Strong knowledge of HIPAA Security Rule safeguards and risk analysis methodology</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Deep expertise in audit methodology, IS control testing, evidence evaluation, and risk-based audit approach</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ability to translate complex security findings into board-ready insights and actionable remediation plans</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Comfortable managing CAPA lifecycles and conducting CAPA verification across audit cycles</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>AVAILABILITY COMMITMENT</strong></p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Audit windows blocked in advance; no competing assignments during fieldwork periods</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4-hour response for compliance-critical queries during active audit periods</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Backup: qualified ISO 27001 Lead Auditor of equivalent seniority assigned in case of unforeseen unavailability</p>	DIRECT	\N	\N	APPROVED	\N	\N	\N	282	10	2026-08-17 15:12:58.479	2026-06-18 15:12:58.479	2026-06-18 15:04:06.136	2026-08-02 16:02:15.006
