e259ef00-bea0-4165-bb26-e8b5aa09fac7	f08439d5-0d19-4d90-ae2d-fffc886abc70	Website Security Analyst	Glowtouch Technologies Pvt.Ltd	Mangalore, Karnataka	Full-time	2018-10	2024-12	f	 Served as an L2/L3 Website Security Analyst, managing security incidents across 1,000+ customer websites\nin a 24×7 security operations environment.\n Handled escalated website security incidents requiring advanced investigation, evidence correlation, and\ntechnical analysis to support timely remediation and SLA compliance.\n Correlated server, error, WHM, and cPanel logs to investigate complex website security incidents, identify\nattack vectors, perform root cause analysis, and support incident remediation.\n Managed the end-to-end incident response lifecycle, documenting findings in Salesforce CRM, coordinating\nwith customers and internal teams, and contributing to the remediation of 1,000+ compromised websites\nacross multiple hosting environments.\n Analyzed and remediated malware infections by identifying malicious code, restoring compromised\nwebsites, and implementing security hardening measures that reduced repeat compromises and\nstrengthened the overall security posture of customer websites.\n Investigated website compromises involving web shells, malicious redirects, phishing pages, spam\ninjections, and backdoor malware to determine attack vectors and support effective remediation.\n Identified and remediated web application vulnerabilities, including Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) and SQL\nInjection (SQLi), improving the overall security posture of customer websites.\n Performed IOC enrichment using VirusTotal, WHOIS, and other OSINT sources to investigate suspicious IP\naddresses, domains, URLs, and file hashes.\n Utilized Google Site Search to identify malicious indexing, spam pages, blacklist issues, and compromised\nwebsite content, supporting effective remediation efforts.\n Maintained detailed incident documentation, investigation findings, remediation actions, and technical\nupdates to support incident tracking, knowledge sharing, and audit requirements.	{VirusTotal,WHOIS,"Malware Analysis","Incident Investigation","Security Monitoring","Log Analysis","Root Cause Analysis","Website Remediation","Web Application Security","IOC Investigation & Enrichment","OSINT Investigation","Incident Response","Splunk Enterprise Security","Microsoft Sentinel","CrowdStrike Falcon","Alert Triage","Threat Hunting","Threat Intelligence"}	{}	2026-07-12 14:51:08.378	2026-07-12 14:51:08.378
befe3a52-a8ec-49d1-9e43-32d3cf764b1b	0d7a5665-68c8-4e8d-9bf6-b233a16fff0e	Manager, GRC Engineering	Workstreet	Remote	Full-time	2025-11	2026-07	f	As Manager, GRC Engineering at Workstreet, I lead end-to-end Governance, Risk, and Compliance (GRC) engagements for clients across BFSI, Healthcare, SaaS, and Technology sectors. I serve as the primary client advisor, translating complex regulatory and security requirements into practical compliance programs aligned with business objectives.\n\nMy responsibilities include managing SOC 2 Type I & II, ISO 27001:2022, HIPAA, and PCI DSS compliance initiatives from project scoping through certification. I conduct security risk assessments, gap analyses, control design, policy and procedure development, evidence reviews, audit coordination, and remediation management to ensure continuous compliance and audit readiness.\n\nI oversee a portfolio of client engagements, ensuring timely delivery, quality assurance, and customer satisfaction while mentoring a team of GRC analysts. I work closely with engineering, IT, legal, and executive stakeholders to integrate security controls into cloud environments (AWS, Azure, and GCP) and strengthen governance processes. I also leverage compliance automation platforms such as Drata, Vanta, and Secureframe to streamline evidence collection, monitor control effectiveness, and improve operational efficiency.\n\nAdditionally, I monitor evolving regulatory requirements and industry standards, providing strategic guidance on cybersecurity governance, risk management, third-party risk, business continuity, and security best practices. My focus is on enabling organizations to build scalable compliance programs, reduce cyber risk, achieve successful certifications, and maintain long-term regulatory compliance while aligning security initiatives with business goals.	{Vanta,Secureframe,Drata}	{}	2026-07-14 06:37:23.062	2026-07-14 06:37:23.062
