4dd2e77c-f473-4332-9fea-51db7deae465	49c9ccd3-6513-41a4-8ac9-ee5395184f1d	SAP GRC Project	I am an SAP Security and GRC Analyst  of hands-on experience in delivering secure, compliant, and efficient SAP environments. My expertise spans across user administration, role design, authorization management, and security troubleshooting across ECC, BW, CRM, FIORI, and GRC modules.\n\nI have been actively involved in GRC Access Control (ARM, ARA, EAM) for access risk analysis, firefighter management, and SOD analysis. I focus on building robust access controls and minimizing risks while enabling smooth business operations.\n\nKnown for my analytical approach, attention to detail, and commitment to quality delivery, I collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams to meet audit requirements and enhance security posture.	{"SAP Security, Fiori and GRC"}		2022-03	2025-07	f	{}	2026-02-12 16:59:05.814	2026-02-12 16:59:05.814
11470b6a-4aeb-4e7f-bd93-435c0d60f42c	39e0eb79-11c4-45db-b662-a9b488b703a3	Nyrstar Business Systems	Nyrstar handles end to end operations in Mining and Metals industries and our responsibility is to manage the Security and Audits of the organisation via SAP.	{"SAP S/4 HANA","SAP ECC","SAP GRC"}		2023-11	\N	t	{"Reduces Risks and performed Enhancements"}	2026-02-13 02:27:24.191	2026-02-13 02:27:24.191
